/E (Government Engineering College Patan celebrated its Grand Annual Function, PRAGATI-2026, with immense enthusiasm on 10th April 2026. The prestigious event commenced with an inspiring address by the Honorable Principal, Dr. B. J. Shah Sir. He proudly highlighted the institute's collective team efforts, outstanding academic contributions, and remarkable overall institutional achievements.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [10]
>>
