<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 240 0 R
/E (   Poshan Pakhwada was organized to promote awareness about nutrition, healthy eating habits, and overall well-being under the Poshan Abhiyaan. NSS volunteers visited nearby villages, Katpur and Rajpur, where they conducted door-to-door surveys to assess the nutritional status and health practices of families. They collected information on the use of medical facilities, children's nutrition, and dietary habits. Volunteers also educated villagers about balanced diets, malnutrition, hygiene, and healthy eating practices. The campaign helped increase community awareness and encouraged healthier lifestyles.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
794 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 240 0 R
/T (  Nasha Mukti Abhiyan was organized to spread awareness about the harmful effects of drug addiction and promote a healthy, addiction-free lifestyle. NSS volunteers conducted rallies, slogan chanting, poster presentations, and awareness sessions in Rajpur village. They interacted with villagers and youth to educate them about the physical, mental, and social impacts of substance abuse and encouraged them to adopt healthy habits and stay away from drugs. The campaign successfully promoted awareness and community participation towards building a drug-free society.)
/E (  Nasha Mukti Abhiyan was organized to spread awareness about the harmful effects of drug addiction and promote a healthy, addiction-free lifestyle. NSS volunteers conducted rallies, slogan chanting, poster presentations, and awareness sessions in Rajpur village. They interacted with villagers and youth to educate them about the physical, mental, and social impacts of substance abuse and encouraged them to adopt healthy habits and stay away from drugs. The campaign successfully promoted awareness and community participation towards building a drug-free society.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
