/E (Under the "Ek Ped Maa Ke Naam" initiative, NSS volunteers organized a tree plantation drive with the students of Rajpur Primary School to promote environmental awareness. Students actively participated in planting saplings and learned about the importance of trees in maintaining ecological balance. They were also taken on a visit to the NSS Garden, where volunteers introduced them to different plant species, gardening practices, and the importance of green spaces. The activity encouraged young students to develop a sense of responsibility towards nature and environmental conservation.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [11]
