/Title (On the occasion of World Environment Day 2026, the NSS Unit of Government Engineering College, Patan organized various activities to promote environmental awareness and sustainable living under the theme "Our Earth, Our Responsibility, Our Future." NSS volunteers participated in a tree plantation drive to encourage afforestation and environmental conservation. An Environment Awareness Quiz Competition was also conducted to enhance students' knowledge about climate change, biodiversity, waste management, and sustainable development. The program successfully inspired students and the community to adopt eco-friendly practices and contribute towards a greener future.)
/Dest [32 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3012 0 R
>>
