/Title (The NSS Orientation Program 2026 was organized to introduce new students to the values and objectives of the National Service Scheme. The program began with a Lamp Lighting ceremony, followed by an introduction to NSS and the NSS Song. Motivational speeches by the Principal and faculty members inspired students to participate in community service. A video and PPT showcased the activities and achievements of NSS GEC Patan, while senior volunteers shared their experiences and the impact of NSS on their personal growth. The program concluded with a Vote of Thanks, encouraging students to actively contribute to society through NSS.)
/Dest [32 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3326 0 R
/Next 3604 0 R
>>
