/Title (International Yoga Day 2026 was celebrated on 21st June at Government Engineering College, Patan to promote the importance of yoga for physical health, mental well-being, and a balanced lifestyle. The program began with the Honorable Prime Minister's virtual address, highlighting the significance of yoga in daily life. Around 80 students and faculty members actively participated in the event, followed by a practical yoga session that included yoga asanas, pranayama, and meditation. The celebration successfully encouraged participants to adopt yoga as a part of a healthy and disciplined lifestyle.)
/Dest [33 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3328 0 R
>>
