/Title (Nasha Mukti Abhiyan was organized to spread awareness about the harmful effects of drug addiction and promote a healthy, addiction-free lifestyle. NSS volunteers conducted rallies, slogan chanting, poster presentations, and awareness sessions in Rajpur village. They interacted with villagers and youth to educate them about the physical, mental, and social impacts of substance abuse and encouraged them to adopt healthy habits and stay away from drugs. The campaign successfully promoted awareness and community participation towards building a drug-free society.)
